@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cart Service Experiencing Instability
+
+## Description
+
+We are observing an increase in memory consumption within the cart service, leading to intermittent service unresponsiveness and restarts. Users may experience issues with adding items to their carts or retrieving existing cart information. This is impacting the overall user experience and the ability to complete purchases.
